OL,3,GNEWSACall for warnings review near
OL,4,Acrossing death crash site
OL,5,
OL,6,FA councillor is calling for more
OL,7,Fwarning signs near a rural railway
OL,8,Fcrossing where a van driver was killed
OL,9,Fin a collision with a train.
OL,11,FA Northern service travelling from
OL,12,FSouthport to Manchester struck a
OL,13,Fdelivery van at the manually operated
OL,14,Fcrossing off Martin Lane and Whitehouse
OL,15,FLane in Burscough at about 15:00 BST on
OL,16,FSaturday.
OL,18,FCounty councillor Rick Edwards said
OL,19,Fthere needed to be more warning signs
OL,20,Fon the run up to the crossing, adding
OL,21,Fthat "we can't afford [for] this to
OL,22,Fhappen again".
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
